OL,3,GNEWSATwo officers injured in car
OL,4,Aramming after police chase suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter two police officers were injured
OL,8,Fin a car ramming in Londonderry on
OL,9,FThursday.
OL,11,FIt happened on an estate in Galliagh,
OL,12,Fafter a police pursuit that began in
OL,13,Fthe Waterside.
OL,15,FThe suspect was arrested for a number
OL,16,Fof offences, including attempted
OL,17,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent,
OL,18,Fdangerous driving, driving while
OL,19,Fdisqualified, criminal damage and
OL,20,Fpossession of a class A drug.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
