OL,3,GNEWSATwo officers injured in car
OL,4,Aramming after police chase suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Police will not tolerate reckless and
OL,7,Fdangerous driving and will continue to
OL,8,Fensure those who pose a danger to road
OL,9,Fusers are taken off of our roads," said
OL,10,Fthe PSNI in a statement.
